    "Move {0} a month to reach {1} in {2} years.": "Tshimbisani {0} nga ṅwedzi u swikela {1} nga miṅwaha ya {2}.",
    "Download a backup of your plan": "Dawnilodani mbulungo ya pulane yaṋu",
    "Your answers live only in this browser. A backup file keeps them safe.": "Phindulo dzaṋu dzi dzula kha tshiburaoza itshi fhedzi. Faela ya mbulungo i dzi vhulunga dzo tsireledzea.",
    "Review this plan every six months": "Sedzululani pulane iyi nga murahu ha miṅwedzi miṅwe na miṅwe ya rathi",
    "Update income, spending and goals so projections stay current.": "Khwinisani mbuelo, kushumiselwe kwa tshelede na zwipikwa uri mbalo dzi dzule dzi dza zwino.",
    "MY WEALTH PLAN": "PULANE YANGA YA LUPFUMO",
    "Age {0}, retiring at {1}. Gross pay {2} a month, about {3} take-home. Saving {4}% ({5} a month).": "Miṅwaha ya {0}, ni litsha mushumo ni na miṅwaha ya {1}. Muholo woṱhe ndi {2} nga ṅwedzi, hu ṱoḓou vha {3} ine ya ya hayani. U vhulunga {4}% ({5} nga ṅwedzi).",
    "Chance savings last to {0}: {1}%. Wealth score: {2}/100.": "Zwikhala zwa uri tshelede yo vhulungwaho i swike kha {0}: {1}%. Tshikoro tsha lupfumo: {2}/100.",
    "ACTIONS": "ZWIITO",
    "Educational estimates only, not financial advice.": "Izwi ndi zwikalo zwa u funza fhedzi, a si nyeletshedzo ya zwa masheleni.",
    "Click again to erase all your answers": "Puṱedzani hafhu u phumula phindulo dzaṋu dzoṱhe",
