    "Answer a few questions to see a range of possible futures. Everything stays in your browser.": "Fhindulani mbudziso dzi si gathi u vhona vhumatshelo ho fhambanaho vhune ha nga vha hone. Zwoṱhe zwi dzula kha tshiburaoza tshaṋu.",
    "Ask Stacy": "Vhudzisani Stacy",
    "Start with your profile": "Thomani nga phurofayili yaṋu",
    "Stacy is your on-device money guide. Tap a question or type one in English. Nothing leaves this device.": "Stacy ndi mulivhisi waṋu wa zwa masheleni a re kha tshishumiswa. Puṱedzani mbudziso kana ni thayiphe nthihi nga Luisimane. A hu na tshithu tshine tsha bva kha tshishumiswa itshi.",
    "Your coach's read": "Muhumbulo wa mugudisi waṋu",
