    "Stacy is a maths assistant, not a licensed adviser. Typed questions work best in English.": "Stacy ndi muthusi wa mbalo, a si mueletshedzi a re na ḽaisentsi. Mbudziso dzo thayiphiwaho dzi shuma zwavhuḓi nga maanḓa nga Luisimane.",
