    "An estimate for one salaried job using SARS 2026/27 rates. Your payslip may differ a little.": "Khumbanyelo ya mushumo muthihi une wa badelwa nga u shumisa zwikalo zwa SARS zwa 2026/27. Bammbiri ḽaṋu ḽa muholo ḽi nga fhambana zwiṱuku.",
    "Continue to your budget": "Bvelani phanḓa kha mugaganyagwama waṋu",
