    "Split your income between needs and wants. Whatever's left is what you save.": "Kovhekanyani mbuelo yaṋu vhukati ha ṱhoḓea na zwithu zwine na zwi tama. Tshine tsha sala ndi tshone tshine na tshi vhulunga.",
    "Starting values are illustrative averages, not official statistics. Adjust them to match your life.": "Mbalo dza u thoma ndi zwikalo zwa vhukati zwa u sumbedza fhedzi, a si mbalombalo dza tshiofisi. Dzi lugiseni uri dzi tshimbilelane na vhutshilo haṋu.",
